    "committer": "Patrick Aboyoun <aboyoun.patrick@gene.com>",
    "message": "Fix DuckDBArray Bioconductor nebbiolo2 check NOTEs\n\nVendor a local .extract_Nindex_from_syscall() helper instead of\ncalling unexported S4Arrays:::extract_Nindex_from_syscall() from the\n[ methods for DuckDBArraySeed, DuckDBArray, and DuckDBMatrix.\n\nReplace unanchored \\linkS4class{ArrayGrid} and\n\\link{DuckDBTable-class} Rd cross-references with explicit\n\\link[pkg]{...} package anchors.\n",
    "time": 1794089882
  },
